msgid_plural "handful of shelled peanuts"
msgstr[0] "maréknyi hántolt földimogyoró"
msgstr[1] "maréknyi hántolt földimogyoró"

#. ~ Description for handful of shelled peanuts
#: lang/json/COMESTIBLE_from_json.py
